---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /hi/services/index.html
pageLang: hi
title: हमारी सेवाएँ
description: सुरक्षा गार्ड, सशस्त्र सुरक्षा, हाउसकीपिंग और सुविधा प्रबंधन।
---

{% set enUrl = "/pages/services/" %}
{% include "partials/translation-pending-banner.njk" %}

<section class="container">
  <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
  <div class="card-grid">
    {%- for svc in services.catalog -%}
    <a class="card-link" href="/services/{{ svc.slug }}/">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon">{{ svc.icon }}</div>
        <h3>{{ svc.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ svc.shortDescription }}</p>
      </div>
    </a>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
</section>
